'''Bygone Reminiscence''' is a [[Light Cone Event Warp]] in [[Version 4.6]].

==Event Details==
During the event, the drop rate of the limited 5{{Star}} [[Light Cone]], {{Light Cone Intro|Until the Flowers Bloom Again}} will be boosted.

===Drop Rate Boost: 5{{Star}} Light Cone===
* {{Light Cone Intro|Until the Flowers Bloom Again}}

===Drop Rate Boost: 4{{Star}} Light Cones===
* {{Light Cone Intro|Post-Op Conversation}}
* {{Light Cone Intro|Planetary Rendezvous}}
* {{Light Cone Intro|Boundless Choreo}}

==Notes==
* Among the above Light Cones, the limited Light Cone will not become available in the Stellar Warp event.
* This Warp is counted as a Light Cone Event Warp. The Warp count for the guarantee with any Light Cone Event Warp will always be carried over to other Light Cone Event Warps, but is independent of and unaffected by other types of Warps.
{{For|additional information|Warp}}

